      "statement": "`pnpm run build` is a transpile-and-emit chain that does NOT type check: it runs `tsc -b && tsdown && node scripts/postbuild.mjs` to emit `lib/index.js`, `lib/client.js`, and the `lib/types/` tree; `pnpm run typecheck` is the separate type gate.",
