      "statement": "`pnpm run watch` runs only `tsdown --watch` and does not re-run `tsc -b` or postbuild, so after editing the host face (`src/index.ts`) the rolldown-emitted `lib/index.js` is not re-overwritten by postbuild; a full `pnpm run build` is required before loading the host from a fresh src change.",
