      "id": "claim_3ab62de8017c466184c7901b82016c4e",
      "statement": "The `prepare` script (used by git-source installs) runs `tsc -b && tsdown --config tsdown.prepare.config.ts && node scripts/postbuild.mjs`; unlike `build` it uses a lighter libExternal set (only `@deepseek-ai/dsh-typert-protocol` and `@deepseek-ai/dsh-home-paths` external) because a git-installed package cannot rely on the sibling harness checkout for tsc project references, and types are deliberately not checked there.",
